      "writtenOn": "2023-03-02T06:27:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The charge limit has been set by board_set_charge_limit, but however the charge_manager updates the `charge_current` until the deferred hook is almost finished.\n\nConsider this scenarios:\n\n0. Before PD transition, the `charge_ceil` is 3000mA\n\n1. Set PSNKSTDBY, charge_manager_force_ceil() called, `charge_ceil` set (said 275mA),  charge_manager_refresh deferred.\n\n2. Call board_set_charge_limit() in PD task, the input current limit 275mA is applied.\n\n3.PD SM exiting PE_SNK_TRANSITION_SINK, charge_manager_set_ceil() called, `charge_ceil` is now set to 3000mA. The second charge_manager_refresh deferred.\n\n4. The first charge_manager_refresh deferred is in process, and the charge_manager finds that the charge_ceil doesn\u0027t change (3000mA vs 3000mA), so no new CL is found. board_set_charge_limit is skipped. The input current is actually capped at 275mA, but the `charge_current` in charge_manager has been modified as 3000mA.",
      "parentUuid": "3cac1c25_3d0c5309",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 12,
        "startChar": 42,
        "endLine": 14,
        "endChar": 9
      },
      "revId": "a1e0797aeeee9230d309db5a830ec579b8fd9ed9",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
