      "writtenOn": "2023-03-02T06:27:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are only several places that call board_set_charge_limit() and not through the charge_manager:\n\n1. charge_manager_force_ceil() from PD task in PE_SNK_SELSECT_CAPABILITY.\n2. chg_ramp task, which won\u0027t be supported anymore.\n3. PD CHG CTRL host command, a developer command.\n\nSo, I think there are no other suspects that might cause the race condition.",
      "parentUuid": "6d71a917_0d3f8587",
      "revId": "a1e0797aeeee9230d309db5a830ec579b8fd9ed9",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
